  partName: Right Front Intake Runner Bolt
  description: The Right Front Intake Runner Bolt is a small, elongated bolt positioned
    at the top-right-front of the engine, fabricated from Material.001, which secures
    the intake runner to the engine block, facilitating smooth airflow into the cylinders.
    This bolt is critical for maintaining optimal engine performance and fuel efficiency.
    Notably, its location at the front of the engine allows for easy access during
    maintenance.
